      <p class="meta" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">Serveur EC2 : <strong>""" + INSTANCE_ID + """</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Région : <strong>""" + REGION + """</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Launch Template : <strong>""" + SPOT_LT_ID + """</strong></p>
    </div>
